        card("Culture note: pakikipagkapwa-tao and pakikisama", "Pakikipagkapwa-tao and pakikisama, or “Smooth Interpersonal Relationships” (SIR), are values centered on preserving harmony. Pakikipagkapwa-tao is manifested in a basic sense of justice and fairness and in concern for others. It is demonstrated in the Filipino’s ability to empathize with others, in helpfulness and generosity in times of need (pakikiramay), in the practice of bayanihan or mutual assistance, and in the famous Filipino hospitality. However, pakikisama may result in patronage politics."),
