_D2 = [("Ama A", "Pare, congrats! Sa wakas, may pari ka na. Sobrang blessing ’yan sa pamilya, pare. Parang kailan lang, nung maliit ’yan e, nakikikain at nakikikanta pa sa bahay tuwing Linggo.", "Pare, congrats! At last, you have a priest. That is such a blessing for the family, pare. It seems like only yesterday, when he was small, he was joining in eating and singing at our house every Sunday."), ("Ama B", "Salamat, pare. Sa tatlo, ’yan talaga ang palasimba at madasalin kahit nung bata pa. Ikaw, kumusta na? Narinig kong ikakasal na ang bunso mo. Hindi ba kaka-graduate lang niya ng high school?", "Thank you, pare. Of the three, that one was really churchgoing and prayerful even as a child. How about you? I heard your youngest is getting married. Didn’t he or she just graduate from high school?"), ("Ama A", "Nabuntis, e. Kailangan nilang magpakasal. Malaking kahihiyan ’yun sa pamilya ko. Ano na lang ang sasabihin ng ibang tao? Kahit mahirap lang kami, nabubuhay kami nang marangal!", "She got pregnant. They have to marry. That is a great shame for my family. What will other people say? Even though we are poor, we live honorably!"), ("Ama B", "Hindi bale, maayos naman ’ata ’yung panganay mo.", "Never mind, your eldest seems to be doing well."), ("Ama A", "Ah, si Kute? Oo naman. Sa awa ng Diyos, pare, responsable naman si Kute at marunong tumanaw ng utang na loob. Nangako siya sa amin na makikiambag siya sa gastusin sa bahay, papag-aralin din niya yung sumunod sa kanya, at ipapaayos niya itong bahay namin.", "Ah, Kute? Of course. By God’s mercy, pare, Kute is responsible and knows how to show a debt of gratitude. He or she promised us that he or she will contribute to the household expenses, will also send the next sibling to school, and will have this house of ours repaired.")]
