_A6 = [("Kahapon nakilala ko ang pamilya Robles.", "Yesterday I met the Robles family."), ("May pampamilyang pagpapahalaga ang pamilyang ito.", "This family has family values."), ("Mababait ang mga anak nila.", "Their children are kind."), ("Nasa kanila ang pagiging magalang at masunurin sa mga magulang nila.", "They have the quality of being respectful and obedient to their parents."), ("Mahalaga sa kanila ang pakikisama at pakikipagkapwa-tao.", "Pakikisama and pakikipagkapwa-tao are important to them."), ("Magaling silang makisalamuha at makitungo sa kapwa.", "They are good at mingling and dealing with others."), ("Gaya ng karamihan ng Pilipino, likas na mapagbigay at matulungin ang pamilyang Robles.", "Like most Filipinos, the Robles family is naturally generous and helpful."), ("Sa aspetong ispiritwal, kilala sila sa pagiging madasalin, palasimba, at pagkakaroon ng moralidad at takot sa Diyos.", "In the spiritual aspect, they are known for being prayerful, churchgoing, and having morality and fear of God."), ("Nagtutulungan sila at nakikiramay sila sa oras ng pangangailangan at kagipitan.", "They help one another and sympathize in times of need and difficulty."), ("Matatag at may lakas ng loob sila sa oras ng anumang pagsubok.", "They are resilient and courageous in times of any challenge.")]
_G6 = "The Robles family is an example of an ideal Filipino family. They have good family values and their children are obedient and respectful. They also value getting along well with others, so it is easy to get along with them. Helpful and generous, they are known for being prayerful, regular churchgoers, and God-fearing. When the eldest child is employed, he or she helps in paying for household expenses, helping each other in time of need. They are also strong in times of suffering."
_A7 = [("Gusto ko siya, marunong siyang makisalamuha at makisama.", "I like him or her, he or she knows how to get along with others."), ("Makikikain at makikikanta ako sa kaarawan ni Pareng Onat mamaya.", "I will eat and sing at (my friend) Onat’s birthday later today."), ("Kailangang makisangkot at makiisa ang bawat Pilipino.", "Every Filipino needs to get involved and be united."), ("Makikilahok kami sa piyesta ng bayan sa susunod na linggo.", "We are going to participate in the town fiesta next week."), ("Nakikiambag ang buong pamilya sa pagtulong sa mga nasunugan.", "The whole family is contributing to help the fire victims."), ("Makiramay kayo sa mga taong nabiktima ng malakas na bagyo sa Leyte.", "Show sympathy for the victims of the strong storm in Leyte.")]
_D8 = [("Bongbong", "Ate, salamat sa padala mong pang-tuition. Nakuha ko na po kahapon. Mataas ang dolyar ngayon kaya malaki ang palitan. At last, ilang tulog na lang ga-graduate na ako! Thank you, ate, sa tiwala at pagmamahal. Gaya ng pangako ko, ’pag nakahanap ako ng trabaho, ako naman ang magpapa-aral kay bunso. Sobra-sobra na ang tulong n’yo sa amin. Baka tumanda ka nang dalaga diyan.", "Ate, thank you for the tuition you sent. I got it yesterday. The dollar is high now so the exchange is big. At last, only a few more sleeps and I will graduate! Thank you, ate, for the trust and love. As I promised, when I find a job, I will be the one to send our youngest to school. Your help to us is already too much. You might grow old as a spinster over there."), ("Bongbong", "Seriously, ate, salamat talaga. Dobleng selebrasyon po ’to kasi ga-graduate ng high school si Tasha. Tapos ako, magiging inhinyero na sa wakas! Mabuti na lang wala pang board exam ang computer engineering, gusto ko na kasing magtrabaho at tumulong sa inyo.", "Seriously, ate, thank you very much. This is a double celebration because Tasha will graduate from high school. And I will finally become an engineer! It is a good thing computer engineering has no board exam yet, because I already want to work and help you."), ("Lingling", "Ikaw talaga, walang problema. Nangako ako kina itay at inay nung nabubuhay pa sila na hinding-hindi ko kayo pababayaan. Inspired nga ako ditong magtrabaho kasi ang sisipag n’yong mag-aral. Hindi ko na kailangang mag-asawa para sumaya. Kayo lang, sobra-sobra na. Siyanga pala, huwag n’yong kalimutang magpasalamat sa Diyos sa lahat ng biyaya. Malapit nang magsimula ang simbang gabi, kumpletuhin n’yo ha. At ’wag kalimutang magdasal bago matulog. Bilin ’yan nina Itay at Inay. Excited na ako sa graduation mo. I-upload mo agad, ha?!", "You really are something, no problem. I promised Itay and Inay when they were still alive that I would never ever leave you. I am inspired to work here because you study so hard. I do not need to marry to be happy. You alone are more than enough. By the way, do not forget to thank God for all the blessings. The simbang gabi is about to begin, complete it, okay. And do not forget to pray before sleeping. That is Itay’s and Inay’s reminder. I am excited for your graduation. Upload it right away, okay?!")]
_K8A = [("1. The main idea", "Bongbong is thanking his sister for the money she sent."), ("2. Four to six supporting details", "He thanked his sister for the tuition she sent. He said the exchange rate is high. He also thanked his sister for her love and trust. Just as he promised her, he will send his younger sibling to school after he graduates from college. He said his sister’s help to the family is too much and that she might end up an old maid. He will graduate in computer engineering, and his younger sister will also graduate in high school. He said it is a good thing that computer engineering has no board exam because he wants to find a job immediately and help his siblings."), ("3. Three reminders Lingling has for her brother and siblings", "(1) Do not forget to thank God for all the blessings; (2) complete the nine-day simbang gabi, the dawn or night mass; (3) do not forget to pray before going to sleep."), ("4a. Lingling’s love for her parents and siblings (1)", "Nangako ako kina itay at inay nung nabubuhay pa sila na hinding-hindi ko kayo pababayaan. Translation: I promised Mom and Dad when they were still alive that I would never ever leave you."), ("4b. (2)", "Inspired nga ako ditong magtrabaho kasi ang sisipag n’yong mag-aral. Translation: I am very inspired working here because you are all very hardworking in your studies."), ("4c. (3)", "Hindi ko na kailangang mag-asawa para sumaya. Kayo lang, sobra-sobra na. Translation: I do not need to find a husband to be happy. You, my siblings, are more than enough.")]
